  "label": "Islamophobia - Sharia Law Fearmongering",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references the fear of Sharia law, which is a common element of Islamophobia. This fear is used to frame the act of killing Muslims in a mosque as a 'success' that ISIS does not claim, which is a dangerous and false narrative. This stereotype is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the hateful intent of the meme.",
